<view class="auth-container">
  <view class="auth-card">
    <view class="auth-header">
      <view class="auth-icon-circle">🐾</view>
      <view class="auth-title">欢迎参加 Pawscars</view>
      <view class="auth-subtitle">请先绑定你的社群活动ID (LDAP)</view>
    </view>

    <view class="auth-form">
      <view class="input-label">活动ID (LDAP)</view>
      <input 
        class="ldap-input {{hasError ? 'input-error' : ''}}" 
        placeholder="例如：JENNIFER（仅限英文字母）" 
        value="{{ldapInput}}"
        bindinput="onInputLdap"
        maxlength="20"
      />
      <view wx:if="{{hasError}}" class="error-msg">{{errorMessage}}</view>
      <view class="rule-hint">
        ℹ️ 说明：ID 用于评选身份标识与拉票辨识（前端展示时会自动隐去部分字母如 JE****** 保障隐私）。
      </view>

      <button class="paw-btn paw-btn-primary submit-btn" bindtap="onSubmitBinding">
        确认绑定
      </button>
    </view>

    <!-- ID申诉入口 -->
    <view class="appeal-box">
      <text class="appeal-title">ID 被他人占用了？</text>
      <text class="appeal-desc">若发现常用 ID 被误占用，请点击下方联系管理员核实解绑：</text>
      <view class="appeal-action" bindtap="onContactAdmin">
        <text class="appeal-link">📩 联系管理员申诉</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
